==Battleground==
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 22~23.33 seconds<sup>660f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>, delay 23.33~25.33 seconds<sup>700f~760f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage is fairly easy, with Maawth being possibly the only threatening enemy due to his high range. Simply meatshield and use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to slowly chip away at the frontline. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)#tabber-Surfer Cat|Castaway Cat]] can see some use here as well.

